Package: gmk67-rgb
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Daniel Alvarez <criticalgeek1@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0 (>= 4.12), gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.4)
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/aloran-dev/gmk67-rgb
Description: RGB lighting control for the Zuoya GMK67 keyboard
 GTK4/libadwaita app to set the lighting effect, color, brightness,
 speed and direction of the Zuoya GMK67 (v1, 05ac:024f) keyboard over
 USB. Installs a udev rule that gives the logged-in user access to the
 keyboard's hidraw device.
